{"id":"642748","name":"爆汁面藕","author":"乔拉","authorId":"7000253","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/642748/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"面藕","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"黄瓜丝","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"碗内放入麻酱。","img":"images/642748/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"加入清水搅拌均匀。","img":"images/642748/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"放入生抽。","img":"images/642748/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"放入醋。","img":"images/642748/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"放入糖。","img":"images/642748/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"放入盐。","img":"images/642748/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"放入蚝油。","img":"images/642748/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"加入黄瓜丝。","img":"images/642748/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"加入蒜末。","img":"images/642748/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"倒入调好的料汁拌匀。","img":"images/642748/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"撒上小米椒圈（米椒圈我是切好冷冻保存的，取用方便）。","img":"images/642748/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"酸甜可口，香气扑鼻。","img":"images/642748/step_12.jpg"}],"tips":"调料汁的时候如果想要酸甜口，糖和醋的比例控制在1：1，这样做出来口感最好。 \n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：其他\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}